    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "His father, Wilbur Colom, also a lawyer, was the Republican nominee for state treasurer in 1987, and his mother, Dorothy Colom…",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384197697:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Colom earned a Bachelor of Arts with a double major in English and history from Millsaps College in 2005 and a Juris Doctor, cum laude, from the University of Wisconsin Law School in 2009.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384197697:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "Scott Winston Colom (; born December 24, 1982) is an American lawyer and politician serving since 2016 as district attorney for the 16th Judicial District of Mississippi.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384197697:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The record lists Scott Colom's birth as 24 December 1983, in Columbus.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q115492489:P569",
        "wd:Q115492489:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "His education includes Millsaps College and the University of Wisconsin–Madison.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q115492489:P69:Q6860022",
        "wd:Q115492489:P69:Q838330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to the article on Cindy Hyde-Smith, which drew 81,671 readers.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Cindy_Hyde-Smith:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, 132,877 people read the English article, about 303 times the usual daily count.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Scott_Colom:2026-11-05",
        "views:en:Scott_Colom:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 5 languages, and after English, Spanish readers were the most numerous at 713.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Scott_Colom:2026-11-05",
        "views:es:Scott_Colom:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
